* -bt on a 68020: a branch to an external long (bsr.l, b<cc>.l), whatever its size; no spanreg
* needed (Ultra C's r68, measured 2026-10-18). Before, -bt was -b: word branches.
* fixed: 08be2bc 2026-10-19 r68togas, gastor68: round trip closer to the source; -bt with spanreg; -mspanreg
* options: -bt -m2
* expect text: 61ff00000000 67ff00000000 60ff00000000 4e71
* expect reloc: R_68K_PC32        ext
 psect t,0,0,0,0,0
 bsr ext
 beq.s ext
 bra.w ext
 nop
 ends
